                <pb facs="0139" n="23" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg23"/>

                <head>Arbitration agreement between the United States and Austria-Hungary, extending
                    the duration of the Convention of January 15, 1909<anchor n="1" xml:id="ch22-f1"
                    />
                </head>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington, May 6, 1914; ratification advised
                        by the Senate, May 20, 1914; ratified by the President, May 27, 1914;
                        ratified by Austria-Hungary, May 13, 1914; ratifications exchanged at
                        Washington, May 28, 1914; proclaimed, May 28, 1914</hi>.</p>

